  "notes": "Timeline = gapless mp3 decode (same as data/audio.json). Method: (1) CTC emissions (20 ms frames) of the Demucs vocal stem from two acoustic models, torchaudio MMS_FA and wav2vec2-large-lv60k-960h, each on the mono sum and on the left and right channels, fused as a probability mixture; (2) one global constrained Viterbi forced alignment of every line over the whole song with a garbage 'star' token between lines to absorb ad-libs; (3) signal refinement per syllable unit on the vocal stem: start moved to the voice re-entry after a rest, snapped to the nearest spectral-flux onset, or moved back to the start of s/sh/ch/f/th frication; ends = next word start when legato, else when the voice drops 15 dB below the word level (held notes keep their full length); (4) cross-check against faster-whisper large-v3-turbo word timestamps and the individual models/channels, plus a mel-roformer karaoke lead-vocal stem; (5) ANCHORS/FIX in align.py are empty (no manual QA pass done yet for this song) -- add entries there after reviewing `align.py --plots` output in analysis/qa/ if a word looks mis-placed. conf: 0.35 + agreement of the independent alignments (<=60 ms) + CTC posterior + Whisper agreement; manual fixes (once added) carry their own conf."
